lass=\"kw881\">std::<span class=\"me2\">error_code</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares two error code objects.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Compares <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> for equality.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Compares <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> for equality.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Checks whether <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> is less than <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>. </div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Obtains three-way comparison result of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>.</div>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<p>The <code>&lt;</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, and <code>!=</code> operators are <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/operators#Comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span></span> and <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span></span> respectively.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> error codes to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the error category and error value compare equal.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the error category or error value compare are not equal.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">category</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">category</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. Otherwise, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">category</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">category</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> lhs.<span class=\"me1\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. Otherwise, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">category</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">category</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> if it is not <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">strong_ordering</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">equal</span></span></code>. Otherwise, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/error_code/category\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>category</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains the error_category for this error_code <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/error_code/value\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>value</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains the value of the <code>error_code</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/error_condition/operator_cmp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator==</span><span>operator!=</span><span>operator&lt;</span><span>operator&lt;=&gt;</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(removed in C++20)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(removed in C++20)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares <code>error_condition</code>s and <code>error_code</code>s <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"error","title":"Diagnostics library"},{"path":"error/error_code","title":"std::error_code"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::operator==,!=,<,<=>(std::error_code)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations; revisions: since C++11, until C++20, since C++20. Compares two error code objects."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"lhs, rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the error category and error value compare equal."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"category","note":"obtains the error_category for this error_code"},{"label":"value","note":"obtains the value of the error_code"},{"label":"operator==, operator!=, operator<, …","note":"compares error_conditions and error_codes"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":210,"codeBlockCount":0}
